# Civic editorial UI

PermitPilot is unofficial. Keep Source Sans 3, italic Source Serif 4, Swiss red, green, and the paper palette. Do not copy admin.ch (coat of arms, Frutiger, mandatory red header bar).

## Tokens

- Controls: `--radius: 4px`. Content surfaces: `0`.
- Separate with whitespace, then a hairline, then a 3–5% background shift. A bordered box is a last resort.
- No `backdrop-filter`, radial color blobs, soft hover-lifts (`translateY` + shadow), glass pills, or 17–30px radii.
- Theme: `data-theme="light|dark"` on `html`. Default mode is `auto` (system `prefers-color-scheme`). Recolor via tokens, not extra cards or neon-on-dark.

## Layout

- Default content is borderless. Do not wrap How, sources, history, or result sections in cards.
- Wizard answers are a single-column radio list (`fieldset` + rows). Height follows the label and hint. No `min-height` tiles, mint badges, or corner arrows.
- Selected answer: red left rule or filled radio — not a second card border.
- Semantic left rules only for real status (alerts, disclaimer).
- Small chips (history kind, actor tag) are allowed. Full-width rounded tiles are not.

```css
/* ❌ BAD */
.choice { min-height: 210px; border-radius: 22px; box-shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(0,0,0,.07); }
.site-shell { background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(223,63,63,.06), transparent); }

/* ✅ GOOD */
.choice { padding: 14px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); box-shadow: inset 3px 0 0 transparent; }
.choice.selected { box-shadow: inset 3px 0 0 var(--red); }
```
